{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two people stood on the bridge. They smiled and looked into each other's eyes. Suddenly, the boy whispered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I know everything.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl shuddered with terror. A third participant in the drama entered the scene - a knife. The corpse fell and disappeared into the raging river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that's for the last day. As of right now.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features for the demo version:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* The demo version of the visual novel presents the first introduction of the main characters. It will be possible to learn a little about their personality and the environment around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The demo version is about 15 minutes long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*No answer choices, no endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The demo version is available in Chinese, Russian, Japanese, English.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626980?t=1743880002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626980/b6ecabbf02f51a33d1cb5a5c53cb5f7d12d1cabd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743880002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626980/2c03c93efbb7f49f14bffd22f886b415215855d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743880002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626980/2c03c93efbb7f49f14bffd22f886b415215855d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743880002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Depression, suicide, drinking alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two people stood on the bridge. They smiled and looked into each other's eyes. Suddenly, the boy whispered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I know everything.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girl shuddered with terror. A third participant in the drama entered the scene - a knife. The corpse fell and disappeared into the raging river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that's for the last day. As of right now.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features for the demo version:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* The demo version of the visual novel presents the first introduction of the main characters. It will be possible to learn a little about their personality and the environment around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The demo version is about 15 minutes long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*No answer choices, no endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The demo version is available in Chinese, Russian, Japanese, English.</p>","developers":["Drimmar"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3615870","name":"Farewell, we see each other for the last time....."},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626980/d340538136da8cb15a6eaea4407e6e84ebba77b2/header.jpg?t=1743880002","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119296,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119296/movie480.mp4?t=1743879994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119296/movie_max.mp4?t=1743879994"},"name":"Farewell, we see each other for the last time.....","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119296/13cf96579204a15a90122321022fa71dea2db2dd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743879994","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119296/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743879994","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119296/movie_max_vp9.